The world outline under the workbench geo map (apps/web/src/assets/world-110m.ts)
is derived from Natural Earth 1:110m land polygons, which are in the public domain
(https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/). It is generated by
scripts/world-outline.ts.

The built web application and the container image also contain third-party
npm packages, mostly under the MIT license, and some under the ISC,
BSD-3-Clause and Apache-2.0 licenses. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES lists every one of
them with its license texts, and the font license texts. It is generated by
scripts/third-party-notices.ts (CI checks that it is current), shipped in the
container image as /app/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES, and served by the application as
/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt (linked from Account > About). The CycloneDX SBOM
produced in CI (`pnpm sbom --sbom-format cyclonedx --prod`) lists every
production dependency.
